### 0. Walkthrough: Alice, Bob, Carol, Dan -> all on elevator 0, avg wait 2.0, avg total 6.75, lastTick 15
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elevators": 2,
  "floors": 10,
  "capacity": 4,
  "requests": [
    {"time": 0, "id": "Alice", "source": 1, "dest": 8},
    {"time": 0, "id": "Bob",   "source": 1, "dest": 5},
    {"time": 3, "id": "Carol", "source": 7, "dest": 2},
    {"time": 4, "id": "Dan",   "source": 6, "dest": 9}
  ]
}

### 1. Brief sample, 2 cars -> passenger3 goes to car 1 (pickup 29, drop-off 48), avg total 41.33
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elevators": 2,
  "floors": 51,
  "capacity": 10,
  "requests": [
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger1", "source": 1,  "dest": 51},
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger2", "source": 1,  "dest": 37},
    {"time": 10, "id": "passenger3", "source": 20, "dest": 1}
  ]
}

### 2. Same requests, 1 car -> passenger3 waits 71 ticks, avg total 58.67
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elevators": 1,
  "floors": 51,
  "capacity": 10,
  "requests": [
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger1", "source": 1,  "dest": 51},
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger2", "source": 1,  "dest": 37},
    {"time": 10, "id": "passenger3", "source": 20, "dest": 1}
  ]
}

### 3. Compare all three schedulers on the same requests
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elevators": 2,
  "floors": 20,
  "capacity": 4,
  "requests": [
    {"time": 0, "id": "a", "source": 1,  "dest": 15},
    {"time": 0, "id": "b", "source": 1,  "dest": 9},
    {"time": 1, "id": "c", "source": 12, "dest": 1},
    {"time": 2, "id": "d", "source": 5,  "dest": 18},
    {"time": 3, "id": "e", "source": 20, "dest": 2},
    {"time": 4, "id": "f", "source": 1,  "dest": 6},
    {"time": 6, "id": "g", "source": 8,  "dest": 1},
    {"time": 9, "id": "h", "source": 3,  "dest": 14}
  ]
}

### 4. Pick a scheduler explicitly (DISPATCH or NEAREST_CAR)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elevators": 2,
  "floors": 51,
  "capacity": 10,
  "scheduler": "NEAREST_CAR",
  "requests": [
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger1", "source": 1,  "dest": 51},
    {"time": 0,  "id": "passenger2", "source": 1,  "dest": 37},
    {"time": 10, "id": "passenger3", "source": 20, "dest": 1}
  ]
}

